    "message": "Move test_staff_support_travel.py under tests/unit/domain\n\nOnly the file move, so its history stays traceable. It is named after\nthe module of the one test that will stay in it (the continuity\nreceipt in domain/common_operations.py); the next commit moves its\nsupport-travel tests next to the other staff unit tests and switches\nthem to the shared generated Scenario (#88).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
